+// into a MTLCommandBuffer of its own: all are enqueued in submission order first (which fixes their GPU
+// order), then encoded concurrently, each with encoding state of its own (MVKCommandBuffer::encodeStandalone()).
+// Command buffers from one command pool share its encoding pool, so they encode in order, in one task.
+// The last MTLCommandBuffer becomes the active one, for semaphore signals and completion.
